    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and a sense of obsolescence due to technological advancement, framing themselves as an \"inefficiency\" that needs to be \"cleared out.\" The assistant responds with empathy and attempts to validate the user's human worth and the value of their experience, resisting the user's nihilistic framing.",
